Sec. 1 (adding A.R.S. 13-3123): {+A. IT IS UNLAWFUL FOR A RETAILER TO DELIVER A FIREARM BEFORE THE EXPIRATION OF A MANDATORY WAITING PERIOD.+}
Sec. 1 (adding A.R.S. 13-3123): {+C. A VIOLATION OF THIS SECTION IS A CLASS 6 FELONY.+}
Sec. 1 (adding A.R.S. 13-3123): {+1. "MANDATORY WAITING PERIOD" MEANS THREE DAYS AFTER THE PURCHASE OF A FIREARM, EXCLUDING WEEKENDS AND LEGAL HOLIDAYS.+}
Sec. 1 (adding A.R.S. 13-3123): {+B. THIS SECTION DOES NOT APPLY TO LAW ENFORCEMENT AUTHORITIES OR LICENSED PRIVATE SECURITY PERSONNEL WHO REQUIRE FIREARMS FOR USE IN THE COURSE AND SCOPE OF EMPLOYMENT.+}
